{
  "id": "ep265",
  "duration": 31.106,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 3.32,
      "text": "Apollo astronauts discovered the Moon smells like spent gunpowder.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "AS11-36-5393 - Apollo 11 - Apollo 11 Mission image - Astronaut Edwin E. Aldrin inside the Lunar Module - NARA - 16683247.jpg",
        "credit": "Unknown authorUnknown author or not provided",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AS11-36-5393_-_Apollo_11_-_Apollo_11_Mission_image_-_Astronaut_Edwin_E._Aldrin_inside_the_Lunar_Module_-_NARA_-_16683247.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.167,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 2.167,
          "end": 3.333,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 3.32,
      "end": 6.36,
      "text": "They'd track clingy gray grit inside after every moonwalk.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "AS17-134-20471 (21668593222).jpg",
        "credit": "Project Apollo Archive",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AS17-134-20471_(21668593222).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 3.333,
          "end": 4.567,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 4.567,
          "end": 6.367,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 6.36,
      "end": 10.02,
      "text": "This grit floats, creating a ghostly glow on the horizon.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Surveyor 7 Fig 3-43.jpg",
        "credit": "NASA",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Surveyor_7_Fig_3-43.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 6.367,
          "end": 10.033,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 10.02,
      "end": 13.4,
      "text": "Robots and crews even saw long rays stretching into space.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Apollo 17 twilight ray sketch.jpg",
        "credit": "Apollo 17 astronauts",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Apollo_17_twilight_ray_sketch.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 10.033,
          "end": 13.4,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 13.4,
      "end": 17.36,
      "text": "Solar ultraviolet light charges the tiny surface dust particles.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Outreach-Art1-TM (4312250456).jpg",
        "credit": "The Science Directorate at NASA Langley",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Outreach-Art1-TM_(4312250456).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 13.4,
          "end": 17.367,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 17.36,
      "end": 20.44,
      "text": "Static forces push floating dust onto the astronauts' suits.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Apollo 17 - Schmitt bei der Arbeit.jpg",
        "credit": "unbekannt",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Apollo_17_-_Schmitt_bei_der_Arbeit.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 17.367,
          "end": 20.433,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 20.44,
      "end": 23.8,
      "text": "Once a month, Earth's magnetotail whips these grains into storms.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Psjad06aff3 hr.jpg",
        "credit": "Lianghai Xie,\u00a0Lei Li,\u00a0Huizi Wang,\u00a0Binbin Tang,\u00a0Jindong Wang,\u00a0Yiteng Zhang,\u00a0Quanqi Shi,\u00a0Bin Zhou\u00a0and\u00a0Yongyong Feng",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Psjad06aff3_hr.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 20.433,
          "end": 23.8,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 23.8,
      "end": 26.8,
      "text": "That levitating grit is what carries the gunpowder scent inside.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "AS11-36-5388 - Apollo 11 - Apollo 11 Mission image - Astronaut inside the Lunar Module - NARA - 16683232.jpg",
        "credit": "Unknown authorUnknown author or not provided",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AS11-36-5388_-_Apollo_11_-_Apollo_11_Mission_image_-_Astronaut_inside_the_Lunar_Module_-_NARA_-_16683232.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 23.8,
          "end": 25.767,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 25.767,
          "end": 26.8,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 26.8,
      "end": 30.756,
      "text": "Every return mission proves this weird lunar secret is true.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "AS11-36-5393 - Apollo 11 - Apollo 11 Mission image - Astronaut Edwin E. Aldrin inside the Lunar Module - NARA - 16683247.jpg",
        "credit": "Unknown authorUnknown author or not provided",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:AS11-36-5393_-_Apollo_11_-_Apollo_11_Mission_image_-_Astronaut_Edwin_E._Aldrin_inside_the_Lunar_Module_-_NARA_-_16683247.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
